<% content_for :title, "Community Guidelines — No Crumbs" %>

<div class="nc-static-page">
  <div class="nc-static-hero">
    <h1>Community <span>Guidelines</span></h1>
    <p class="nc-static-lead">How we keep NoCrumbs a welcoming place for everyone.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="nc-static-body">
    <section>
      <h2>Be respectful</h2>
      <p>Treat every member of the community with kindness and respect. Personal attacks, harassment, bullying, and threatening language of any kind are not tolerated and may result in immediate account suspension.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Keep it appropriate</h2>
      <p>NoCrumbs is a food and community platform open to all ages. Do not post profanity, sexually explicit content, graphic violence, or any other material that is offensive or unsuitable for a general audience.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>No hate speech or discrimination</h2>
      <p>Content that promotes hatred, discrimination, or prejudice based on race, ethnicity, religion, gender, sexual orientation, disability, or any other characteristic is strictly prohibited.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>No spam or misleading content</h2>
      <p>Do not post repetitive, irrelevant, or misleading content. Meal posts should accurately represent what is being shared. Impersonating other users or organizations is not allowed.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Protect privacy</h2>
      <p>Do not share private information about other users without their consent — including personal contact details, photos, or location data.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Enforcement</h2>
      <p>Violations of these guidelines may result in content removal or account suspension at our discretion.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
